# Cursor rules

This file is intentionally a short stub so the repository has a single source of truth.

- **Documentation standards** (Markdown formatting, file organization, content rules, style guide, changelog policy): follow **[CLAUDE.md](CLAUDE.md)**. This is the source of truth.
